⍝ Load one file of each type and use it. Run:
⍝   dyalog sample-scripts/file-types/use-all.apls
here←⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
Fix←{⎕FIX'file://',here,⍵}               ⍝ .apln .aplc .apli (scripts)
Fix2←{2⎕FIX'file://',here,⍵}             ⍝ .aplf .aplo (one function/operator)
⍝ .apla: in array notation a newline means ⋄. Drop comments and blank lines,
⍝ join the rest with ⋄, then evaluate.
NoComment←{(∧\~(⍵='⍝')>≠\⍵='''')/⍵}
Apla←{l←NoComment¨⊃⎕NGET(here,⍵)1 ⋄ ⍎¯3↓∊((∨/¨' '≠l)/l),¨⊂' ⋄ '}

⎕←'── .aplf (function)'
{}Fix2'Avg.aplf' ⋄ ⎕←'Avg 3 1 4 1 5 = ',⍕Avg 3 1 4 1 5

⎕←'── .aplo (operator)'
{}Fix2'Twice.aplo' ⋄ ⎕←'(1∘+)Twice 10 = ',⍕(1∘+)Twice 10

⎕←'── .apln (namespace)'
{}Fix'Stats.apln' ⋄ ⎕←Stats.Summary 3 1 4 1 5 9

⎕←'── .apli + .aplc (interface and classes)'
{}Fix¨'Shape.apli' 'Square.aplc' 'Circle.aplc'
shapes←(⎕NEW Square 3)(⎕NEW Circle 1)
⎕←↑{⍵.Name,': area ',⍕⍵.Area}¨shapes

⎕←'── .apla (array notation)'
g←Apla'Grid.apla' ⋄ ⎕←g ⋄ ⎕←'sum of each row: ',⍕+/g
p←Apla'People.apla'
⎕←'people: ',⍕p.name
⎕←'average age: ',⍕Avg p.age
